    class CuratedJsonDataService {
        -CuratedDataFilePaths filepaths_
        -cache cache_
        +LoadLocations() vector~Location~
        +LoadPersonas() vector~UserPersona~
        +LoadForenamesByCountry() unordered_map~string, forename_list~
        +LoadSurnamesByCountry() unordered_map~string, surname_list~
    }
    note for CuratedJsonDataService "Takes a CuratedDataFilePaths DTO (locations/personas/forenames/surnames paths) once at construction, not per Load* call. Each Load* method memoizes its result in cache_ after its first call."

    class MockCuratedDataService {
        -vector~Location~ locations_
        -vector~UserPersona~ personas_
