        +ReverseGeocode(longitude, latitude) optional~AddressLookupResult~
    }
    note for NominatimAddressService "Queries the public Nominatim API; sleeps 1s per request per its usage policy; returns nullopt on failure or when no usable street address is found"

    class MockAddressService {
        +ReverseGeocode(longitude, latitude) optional~AddressLookupResult~
    }
    note for MockAddressService "Returns a fixed placeholder address ('123 Mock Street', '00000') for --mocked runs, no network call"

